abstract: >-
  Open-source Python toolkit for studying computational resilience, perturbation,
  and restoration in elementary cellular automata and rule-based systems. The
  paper/eca_restoration/ folder contains the standalone benchmark scripts and
  data for the accompanying manuscript on computational restoration.
keywords:
  - cellular automata
  - ruliology
  - complex systems
  - artificial life
  - computational resilience
  - perturbation
  - restoration